// Restricted Software Access By SRP | T1072 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/application/microsoft_windows_software_restriction_policies/win_software_restriction_policies_block.yml
any where winlog.channel:"Application" and (winlog.provider_name:"Microsoft-Windows-SoftwareRestrictionPolicies" and (event.code like~ ("865", "866", "867", "868", "882")))
